lessons.concept:
### Welcome to Java! ☕
Java is one of the most reliable languages in the world. It runs on billions of devices, Minecraft, and Android!

In Java, everything lives inside a class:

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Hello from Java!");
    }
}
```

